    {
      "source": "Determine if a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Point</code></a> is contained by a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Circle.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Circle</code></a> represented by its <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Point.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>center Point</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/geo/Distance.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance radius</code></a>.",
